IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ProcedureDivisionDemo.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT REPORT-FILE ASSIGN TO "REPORT.DAT"
        ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  REPORT-FILE.
01  REPORT-RECORD          PIC X(40).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-A                   PIC 9(5) VALUE 10.
01  WS-B                   PIC 9(5) VALUE 3.
01  WS-RESULT              PIC 9(7).
01  WS-REMAINDER           PIC 9(5).
01  WS-COUNTER             PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01  WS-LIMIT               PIC 9(3) VALUE 5.
01  WS-NAME                PIC X(20).
01  WS-GREETING             PIC X(40).
01  WS-CODE                PIC 9(2) VALUE 2.
01  WS-TABLE.
    05  WS-ITEM OCCURS 5 TIMES INDEXED BY WS-IX.
        10  WS-ITEM-VALUE  PIC 9(4).
01  WS-SEARCH-TARGET        PIC 9(4) VALUE 100.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARAGRAPH.
    MOVE "world" TO WS-NAME.
    STRING "Hello, " DELIMITED BY SIZE
           WS-NAME DELIMITED BY SIZE
           "!" DELIMITED BY SIZE
        INTO WS-GREETING.
    DISPLAY WS-GREETING.

    ADD WS-A TO WS-B GIVING WS-RESULT.
    SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-RESULT.
    MULTIPLY WS-A BY WS-B GIVING WS-RESULT.
    DIVIDE WS-A BY WS-B GIVING WS-RESULT REMAINDER WS-REMAINDER.
    COMPUTE WS-RESULT = (WS-A + WS-B) * 2 - 1.

    IF WS-A > WS-B THEN
        DISPLAY "A is greater"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "B is greater or equal"
    END-IF.

    EVALUATE WS-CODE
        WHEN 1
            DISPLAY "one"
        WHEN 2
            DISPLAY "two"
        WHEN OTHER
            DISPLAY "other"
    END-EVALUATE.

    PERFORM VARYING WS-IX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IX > 5
        MOVE WS-IX TO WS-ITEM-VALUE(WS-IX)
    END-PERFORM.

    PERFORM UNTIL WS-COUNTER >= WS-LIMIT
        ADD 1 TO WS-COUNTER
    END-PERFORM.

    PERFORM REPORT-PARAGRAPH 3 TIMES.

    SEARCH WS-ITEM VARYING WS-IX
        AT END
            DISPLAY "not found"
        WHEN WS-ITEM-VALUE(WS-IX) = WS-SEARCH-TARGET
            DISPLAY "found"
    END-SEARCH.

    OPEN OUTPUT REPORT-FILE.
    MOVE WS-GREETING TO REPORT-RECORD.
    WRITE REPORT-RECORD.
    CLOSE REPORT-FILE.

    STOP RUN.

REPORT-PARAGRAPH.
    DISPLAY "performed".
